<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109611" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποχώρ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>retirement, retreat,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδιναὶ ὑ.</span>
			<i>retirements</i> by the plains, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.34.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελαγίαν ποιεῖσθαι τὴν
			ὑ.</span> make one's <i>retreat</i> by sea, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.28.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰδὼς τολμήσεως ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Def.</u>
					412c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>ebb</i> of the tide, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.Quint.
				3.7
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>cession</i> of property, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				67.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>retiring-place, retreat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3705
			</span></i> (Apollonia ad Rhyndacum). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῆς γαστρός</span>
			<i>an evacuation</i> of the bowels <i>by stool,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				3.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.649
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dieuch.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				4.7.15
			</span></i>, Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.38.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>the vent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				594a13
			</span></i>.</div>
